      operator placed them. We keep an entry with the same BehaviorTree
      ID so callers (e.g. End-to-End Parallel Pipeline's MainSequence)
      can reference "Randomize Sim Products" unconditionally and have it
      succeed-and-continue on hw without branching by config.-->
  <BehaviorTree
    ID="Randomize Sim Products"
    _description="No-op on hardware. Real implementation lives in the sim config."
    _favorite="false"
  >
    <AlwaysSuccess />
  </BehaviorTree>
  <TreeNodesModel>
